The planned directions and the design critic (src/critic.mjs) take ideas, not
text or code, from these public projects, rewritten in first-draft's own words:
anthropics/skills frontend-design (https://github.com/anthropics/skills),
pbakaus/impeccable (https://github.com/pbakaus/impeccable, Apache-2.0) and
abi/screenshot-to-code (https://github.com/abi/screenshot-to-code, MIT).
